			"notes": "> [!WARNING]\n> **Pre-Release / Alpha Build** — This build contains active, in-development work.\n>\n> - **Unstable & Subject to Change:** Features, mechanics, and content are incomplete and may change or break at any time.\n> - **Do NOT Open Existing Worlds:** Always test on a brand-new world or a separate backup copy. Loading existing saves can cause world corruption or permanent data loss.\n> - **Report Issues:** Please report any bugs, crashes, or feedback on the [Issues](https://github.com/LotrExtendedTeam/LotrRenewedExtended/issues) tracker.\n\n### Changes in this Alpha\n- Fixed structure files not having block and item ids fully remapped\n- Fixed extended TileEntities being deleated after second reboot after update\n\n## What's Changed\n* Fix structure files ID remapping and TileEntity remapping by @maximuslotro in https://github.com/LotrExtendedTeam/LotrRenewedExtended/pull/499\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LotrExtendedTeam/LotrRenewedExtended/compare/beta-1.11.0-alpha-1...beta-1.11.0-alpha-2"
