			"notes": "> [!WARNING]\n> **Pre-Release / Alpha Build** — This build contains active, in-development work.\n>\n> - **Unstable & Subject to Change:** Features, mechanics, and content are incomplete and may change or break at any time.\n> - **Do NOT Open Existing Worlds:** Always test on a brand-new world or a separate backup copy. Loading existing saves can cause world corruption or permanent data loss.\n> - **Report Issues:** Please report any bugs, crashes, or feedback on our discord server.\n\n### Changes in this Alpha\n- Added Conquest system with Middle-Earth conquest map, datapack-driven biome data, and server config toggle\n- Conquest now unlocks enemy crafting tables when player faction exceeds table faction by +750\n- Ported 9 faction captain types along with 18 new hired unit types and a proper unit hiring screen\n- Ported Unit Squadrons, Guard Mode, and Horn of Command squad selection with radial quick-select menu\n- Added unit desertion, dismissal, player-to-player unit transfer, and pre-inventory interaction menus\n- Overhauled Farmhands with seed crafting, auto crop selection, workspace caching, and detailed missing-block warnings\n- Fixed 29 existing units having incorrect hiring costs and pledge requirements\n- Refactored Extended block, item, and TileEntity IDs to the `lotrextended` namespace with automatic pre-1.11.0 world dataFixers\n- Migrated playerData from `.json` to `.dat` and moved fellowship/level data under `/lotrextended/`\n- Ported Ancient Armors, Ancient Swords, Ancient Daggers, and Ancient Armor/Blade fragments\n- Ported 6 Pikes and Longspears (Blue Dwarven, Bronze, Gundabad Uruk, Iron, Lindon, Uruk) and Rohan Bow\n- Ported Moon Chisels and added Branding Iron tooltips showing remaining uses before re-heating\n- Ported 7 Fangorn flora blocks (Elfsong, Fangorn’s Beard, Huorn Leaf, Moonflower, Riverweed, Sunfruit, Tears of Yavanna) plus Springleaf and Stone-Root\n- Ported Leeks, Leek Soup (with 3D plate rendering), and 6 berry juices (Blackberry, Blueberry, Cranberry, Elderberry, Raspberry, Wildberry)\n- Added 9 metal nuggets (Black Uruk, Copper, Dwarven, Elven, Galvorn, Gilded Iron, Morgul, Tin, Uruk)\n- Birds can now be caught in birdcages and render inside them\n- Overhauled Banner Protection GUI with a scrollable whitelist (up to 128 entities) and F3 owned-banner position indicators\n- Bandit and invasion spawning per-biome are now datapack-driven, with invasions capped at 2 within render distance\n- Fixed Dunland invasions turning into Isengard invasions on world reload\n- Improved reforging with guaranteed eligible modifiers, higher skillful modifier weights, and fixed reforge tome repairs\n- Added custom handheld vs. inventory model loader and fixed bow draw animations in inventory\n- Fixed server crash on pledged faction kill and potential Middle-Earth chunk generator crash\n- Fixed SMultiBlockChangePacket crash in banner protection world sync\n- Fixed crashes when editing stone engravings, using Weaponracks with Lithium, and leveling farmhands while owner is offline\n- Fixed Trader, Bandit, Invasion, and Barrows timers leaking between singleplayer worlds\n- Fixed broken gemstone ore weights across Middle-Earth biomes\n- Enabled `/seen` and `/firstjoined` commands in both singleplayer and multiplayer\n- Stone signs now support click events\n- Fixed ducks not spawning near water and improved Craban flying AI\n- Increased structure spawn distance from roads and reduced Dunlending structure respawn rates\n- Fixed Extended items ignoring the HideFlags NBT tag\n- Updated German (`de_de`) localization\n\n## What's Changed\n* Make stone signs support click events by @maximuslotro in https://github.com/LotrExtendedTeam/LotrRenewedExtended/pull/448\n* Remap Block/Item namespaces by @maximuslotro in https://github.com/LotrExtendedTeam/LotrRenewedExtended/pull/452\n* Additional craban tweaks experimental by @RichardB122 in https://github.com/LotrExtendedTeam/LotrRenewedExtended/pull/467\n\n..."
		}
